# purpose: the degenerate windows - before the account existed, after its last fact, one with no facts.
# exercises: HISTORY on a fresh account (just OPENED); SUMMARY with count=0 where opening == closing.
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob USD
DEPOSIT alice 10
HISTORY bob
SUMMARY bob 1 1
SUMMARY bob 3 10
SUMMARY alice 4 4
SUMMARY alice 1 3
SUMMARY alice 3 3
HISTORY alice
